    "type": "game",
    "name": "Ariokan - create your cards, break the Meta",
    "steam_appid": 3833620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game in a nutshell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your opponent's life points to 0, or make them run out of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your Mana, Minions and Spells, and complete objectives to summon powerful Legends that can turn the tides of the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit the sinergies of your God's Faction, and deal the fatal blow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you learnt to invent new cards that make your deck better, and become the smartest duelist in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No floodgates, no 10-minutes turns: you get to play and have fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bring your characters into Ariokan's universe. Everything is canon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try decks you don't own against the AI before unlocking them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft a card once, use it everywhere: no need to unlock multiple copies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A vibrant community with tournaments and competitive seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Modding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No &quot;pay to win&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/fa09e79c5d833f1827a17acf385db4b7.poster.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/fa09e79c5d833f1827a17acf385db4b7.webm?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/fa09e79c5d833f1827a17acf385db4b7.mp4?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/a2ac937eca3dde11b8822455ee39e1da.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your cards. Invent combos. Break the Meta</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about facing the same decks over and over: in Ariokan, you have the power to **create your cards** from scratch, **give life** to your original characters, and **break the Meta**. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you prefer to explore existing strategies, there are 4000+ existing cards waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cb2ef7a60a068d816714c23c76ec35f5.poster.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cb2ef7a60a068d816714c23c76ec35f5.webm?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cb2ef7a60a068d816714c23c76ec35f5.mp4?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>in-game Cards Editor</strong>, you can combine the effects and keywords of 8 different Factions to create balanced cards that make your deck, and strategy, truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 27 billions combinations at your disposal, you'll never run out of options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/df9d1632a6643a97cc12e48fb64b1414.avif?t=1751974844\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No floodgates, no 10-minutes turns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards are auto-balanced</strong> (i.e. no &quot;I win&quot; card), and <strong>immediately available</strong>\u00a0worldwide to all players that want to unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cfa87e7114c573e3192dde70e6c8f9c0.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with your fantasies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every card you make, you shape Ariokan and its universe:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add artworks and lore so each card tells your story, adding a <strong>personal touch to your deck</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're more than a player: you're part of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And with every new card, new strategies arise, making Ariokan a game with fresh, new content every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/0366d59e9f1b6d2becffa382119d76ba.avif?t=1751974844\" width=800 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modding: make your own game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can tweak the game rules when you play with your friends, and discover new ways to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invent game modes, share them with other players, and play together: the only limit is your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the God of games?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/23b2079e8a1fc8df01f6813097caf77b.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/685b146d6e2da367cec5a518629aa131.poster.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/685b146d6e2da367cec5a518629aa131.webm?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/685b146d6e2da367cec5a518629aa131.mp4?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Support the closed beta and join the community], or if you want to wait until the Open Beta begins, wishlist it on the Epic Store page (the one you're reading).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't matter if you are a seasoned card game player or if Ariokan will be your first, you're welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what awaits you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No floodgates, no 10-minutes turns: you get to play and have fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bring your characters into Ariokan's universe. Everything is canon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try decks you don't own against the AI before unlocking them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft a card once, use it everywhere: no need to unlock multiple copies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A vibrant community with tournaments and competitive seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Modding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No &quot;pay to win&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No NFTs, Blockchain, or similar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cc76445d97c63b70f49d76f10017cdb3.poster.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cc76445d97c63b70f49d76f10017cdb3.webm?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cc76445d97c63b70f49d76f10017cdb3.mp4?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game in a nutshell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your opponent's life points to 0, or make them run out of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your Mana, Minions and Spells, and complete objectives to summon powerful Legends that can turn the tides of the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit the sinergies of your God's Faction, and deal the fatal blow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you learnt to invent new cards that make your deck better, and become the smartest duelist in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No floodgates, no 10-minutes turns: you get to play and have fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bring your characters into Ariokan's universe. Everything is canon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try decks you don't own against the AI before unlocking them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft a card once, use it everywhere: no need to unlock multiple copies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A vibrant community with tournaments and competitive seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Modding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No &quot;pay to win&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/fa09e79c5d833f1827a17acf385db4b7.poster.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/fa09e79c5d833f1827a17acf385db4b7.webm?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/fa09e79c5d833f1827a17acf385db4b7.mp4?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/a2ac937eca3dde11b8822455ee39e1da.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your cards. Invent combos. Break the Meta</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about facing the same decks over and over: in Ariokan, you have the power to **create your cards** from scratch, **give life** to your original characters, and **break the Meta**. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you prefer to explore existing strategies, there are 4000+ existing cards waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cb2ef7a60a068d816714c23c76ec35f5.poster.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cb2ef7a60a068d816714c23c76ec35f5.webm?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cb2ef7a60a068d816714c23c76ec35f5.mp4?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>in-game Cards Editor</strong>, you can combine the effects and keywords of 8 different Factions to create balanced cards that make your deck, and strategy, truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 27 billions combinations at your disposal, you'll never run out of options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/df9d1632a6643a97cc12e48fb64b1414.avif?t=1751974844\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No floodgates, no 10-minutes turns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards are auto-balanced</strong> (i.e. no &quot;I win&quot; card), and <strong>immediately available</strong>\u00a0worldwide to all players that want to unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cfa87e7114c573e3192dde70e6c8f9c0.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with your fantasies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every card you make, you shape Ariokan and its universe:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add artworks and lore so each card tells your story, adding a <strong>personal touch to your deck</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're more than a player: you're part of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And with every new card, new strategies arise, making Ariokan a game with fresh, new content every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/0366d59e9f1b6d2becffa382119d76ba.avif?t=1751974844\" width=800 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modding: make your own game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can tweak the game rules when you play with your friends, and discover new ways to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invent game modes, share them with other players, and play together: the only limit is your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the God of games?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/23b2079e8a1fc8df01f6813097caf77b.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/685b146d6e2da367cec5a518629aa131.poster.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/685b146d6e2da367cec5a518629aa131.webm?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/685b146d6e2da367cec5a518629aa131.mp4?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Support the closed beta and join the community], or if you want to wait until the Open Beta begins, wishlist it on the Epic Store page (the one you're reading).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't matter if you are a seasoned card game player or if Ariokan will be your first, you're welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what awaits you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No floodgates, no 10-minutes turns: you get to play and have fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bring your characters into Ariokan's universe. Everything is canon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try decks you don't own against the AI before unlocking them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft a card once, use it everywhere: no need to unlock multiple copies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A vibrant community with tournaments and competitive seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Modding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No &quot;pay to win&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No NFTs, Blockchain, or similar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cc76445d97c63b70f49d76f10017cdb3.poster.avif?t=1751974844\" width=700 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cc76445d97c63b70f49d76f10017cdb3.webm?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/cc76445d97c63b70f49d76f10017cdb3.mp4?t=1751974844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
